  "correctValue": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>All normals of circle passes through centre</p><p>Radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2598bbc5-772a-4249-8672-aa02dd26749d-image.png\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>",
